  "solution": "Đường tròn giữa sân có tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>35</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, bán kính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.\n\t\tĐường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, có một véc-tơ chỉ phương là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có một véc-tơ pháp tuyến là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Phương trình tổng quát đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khoảng cách ngắn nhất từ vị trí của Ronaldo đến một điểm thuộc đường tròn giữa sân là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div>",
